    "title": "helix/foundry/directory/v1/directory.proto",
    "description": "The directory of a standalone Foundry install: its one owner, the\nworkspaces they make, and the projects and HelixDB databases (tenants)\nontologies load into. A hosted deployment serves the same routes from its\nown control plane; these are the ones the Foundry site calls, with the same\npaths, verbs and JSON, carrying the fields the site reads.",
    "version": "version not set"
  },
